# Env setup (SAP batch)

Real secrets live in **`.env`** (cursorignored). Edit that file yourself; agents only reference **`.env.example`**.

| Key | Required | What to put |
|-----|----------|-------------|
| `SAP_URL` | Yes for CLI | Full SAP WebGUI URL (`…/sap/bc/gui/sap/its/webgui/?sap-client=…`) |
| `PUPPETEER_EXECUTABLE_PATH` | Optional | Chrome binary if not using default macOS Chrome |

Canvas PAT for messaging is entered in the extension UI (session only), not via `.env`.

```bash
cp .env.example .env   # then set SAP_URL
npm run cli -- open --keep-open
```
